  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "7.0.0: station API keys (X-Api-Key), pinned HTTPS certificates and IPv6 base URLs. Source compatible with 5.x for normal use and needs a rebuild (not binary compatible); without a key or pin it sends what 5.28 sent, and it works with firmware 6.x and 7. Breaks: new AccordionQ2Client(url, null) no longer compiles; ApiGroupBase can't be derived from; a caller's HttpClient no longer gets BaseAddress set; redirects aren't followed. Full list: https://github.com/esharpab/esharp-accordion-projects-webapiclient/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
